  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q07_solution",
      "condition": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABD}$에서 $\\angle\\text{B}=45^\\circ$, $\\overline{\\text{AB}}=6\\sqrt{2}\\text{ cm}$이므로 $\\overline{\\text{AD}} = 6\\sqrt{2}\\sin 45^\\circ = 6\\text{ (cm)}$이다. 직각삼각형 $\\text{ACD}$에서 $\\angle\\text{C}=60^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{CD}} = \\frac{6}{\\tan 60^\\circ} = \\frac{6}{\\sqrt{3}} = 2\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (cm)}, \\quad \\overline{\\text{AC}} = \\frac{6}{\\sin 60^\\circ} = \\frac{6}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = 4\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (cm)}$$ 따라서 $\\overline{\\text{AC}} - \\overline{\\text{CD}} = 4\\sqrt{3} - 2\\sqrt{3} = 2\\sqrt{3}\\text{ (cm)}$이다. 정답은 ①이다.",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABD}$에서 $\\angle\\text{B}=45^\\circ$, $\\overline{\\text{AB}}=6\\sqr"
